- NullPointerException if ref is null (already covered)
- NullPointerException if schema is null? findSchemaResourceRoot may return null; then schema.getId() would NPE. But maybe findSchemaResourceRoot never returns null. Could be a scenario. We can test when findSchemaResourceRoot returns null. Need to mock JsonSchema to return null. That's an exception scenario: NullPointerException on schema.getId().

- NullPointerException if schema.getSchemaNode() returns null; then node.at(...) would NPE. Could be scenario.

- UnsupportedEncodingException is caught and ignored; not thrown.

- The substring call: ref.substring(schema.getId().length()) could throw StringIndexOutOfBoundsException if schema.getId() length > ref length? But condition ensures ref.startsWith(schema.getId()), so length okay.

- jsonPointer.startsWith("#/") may cause NPE if jsonPointer null; but jsonPointer = ref; already null case covered.

- jsonPointer.startsWith("/") also NPE if jsonPointer null.

So exception scenarios: null schema, null schema node.

Also possibly IllegalArgumentException from URLDecoder.decode if charset unsupported? Actually UnsupportedEncodingException is thrown, not IllegalArgumentException. But it's caught.

