- Null schema root handling (findSchemaResourceRoot returns null) => method throws NullPointerException.

- Null schema node handling (schema.getSchemaNode() returns null) with a pointer that starts with '/' to cause node.at call => NullPointerException.

Potential also: UnsupportedEncodingException not thrown because "utf-8" is always supported; but could be simulated via mocking URLDecoder? Not typical.

